  npcName: Tiger
  dialogueLines:
  - I cant believe he betrayed us like that!
  - After everything Ive done for him
  - That backstabber
  - Bring me the knife.
  - Thats not a knife
  - Now I can get revenge... But Ill help you since you helped me.
  - This room is where the ritual happened
  - You need to place personal objects on each pillar
  - Theres a note somewhere here with those items
  - The. Knife.
